<div class="modal" id="payModal"><div class="modalBox"><button class="close" id="closePayButton">×</button><div class="eyebrow">RAID LAUNCH</div><h2 id="payTitle">FREE RAID</h2><p class="muted">Amount: <b id="payAmount">0 SOL</b></p><div class="status" id="payStatus">No wallet required. Each user can launch up to 3 free raids every 24 hours.</div><button class="primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" id="payCampaignButton">Launch Raid</button></div></div>
<div class="modal" id="premiumModal"><div class="modalBox"><button class="close" id="closePremiumButton">×</button><div class="eyebrow">PREMIUM OPERATOR</div><h2>Activate 30 Days</h2><p class="muted">0.15 SOL · your connected wallet becomes your payout wallet.</p><button class="primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" id="payPremiumButton">Pay & Activate Premium</button></div></div>
